The visual content of "Titli" is an absolute love letter to the landscapes of South India. The video is awash in vibrant greens, earthy tones, and traditional architectural imagery, creating a richly romantic setting. The traditional attire—Deepika in a stunning white and gold Kerala Kasavu saree and SRK in a classic white shirt and veshti—grounds the cinematic fantasy in rich, cultural authenticity. 🥻🌄

