​📖 6. A Universal Tale of Finding Completeness
Ultimately, the song succeeds globally because of its poetic narrative. It tells the story of an incomplete soul finding absolute perfection in another’s simplicity. As the chorus soars with the iconic hook, "Banke titli dil uda, uda, uda hai, kahin door..." (Like a butterfly, the heart has flown away, somewhere far...), it resonates with anyone who has ever felt transported by romance.

